<title>UK: UK Conservatives pledge early competition bill.</title>
<headline>UK Conservatives pledge early competition bill.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's ruling Conservatives on Wednesday said in their election manifesto they would introduce a &quot;competition bill&quot; to give greater protection against price-fixing, dumping and other restrictive practices in the first session of a new parliament.</p>
</text>
